    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d627">

                <pb facs="0816" n="734" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg734"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Geofroy</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-10-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 15, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Seward presents his compliments to Mr. Geofroy, and has the honor to
                    communicate, for his information, a copy of a report of the 10th of September,
                    and of its accompaniments, addressed to Major General Banks by Major General
                    Canby, relative to the recent events which have taken place on the Rio
                    Grande.</p>


                <xi:include href="d627-a1.xml" xpointer="d627-a1"/>
